@*
    Anchor for the connection / sync status pill.

    Intentionally empty and stateless. Everything inside is created by wwwroot/js/offline-status.js,
    because the pill has to keep updating while the SignalR circuit is down — which is exactly when
    a Blazor-rendered component cannot update at all.

    Blazor's diff emits no edits for an element whose render-tree children are unchanged, so the
    nodes the script appends here survive layout re-renders. Do not give this component any child
    content or dynamic attributes, or Blazor will start rewriting the subtree and wipe the pill.
*@
<div id="bw-conn-slot" class="bw-conn-slot"></div>
